# TODO: Code Duplication & DRY/KISS Refactoring Plan

> **Scope**: `src/modules/country`, `src/modules/department`, `src/modules/category`, `src/modules/sub-category`, `src/modules/common-data`  
> **Standards Reference**: `AGENTS.md` (Modular Domain Architecture, Promotion Rules, DRY, KISS, Zero Dummy Data)

---

## 1. Executive Summary

Across the four master-data modules (`country`, `department`, `category`, `sub-category`), over **70–80% of component code, utility functions, hooks, and types were duplicate implementations**.

To strictly satisfy DRY and KISS while maintaining clean domain boundaries, all shared master-data primitives, layout components, widgets, hooks, types, constants, and utilities were extracted into **`src/modules/common-data`** with a public barrel export (`index.ts`) and full i18n bundle (`commonEn`).

---

## 2. Comprehensive Duplication Inventory & Status

### A. Shared Utilities (100% Deduplicated)
- [x] **`format-updated-at.ts`** -> Extracted to `src/modules/common-data/utils/format-updated-at.ts`
  - Functions: `formatUpdatedAt()`, `formatUpdatedAtCompact()`, `formatUpdatedAtFull()`.
  - Deleted duplicate copies from `country`, `department`, `category`, `sub-category`.

---

### B. Shared Types & Global Constants (100% Deduplicated)
- [x] **Common Async & Query State Types** -> `src/modules/common-data/types/common-data.types.ts`
  - `CommonStatus`, `TimeRange`, `StatTone`, `StatItem`, `StatOverview`, `ListingView`, `PageSize`, `SelectOption`, `ImageChipItem`.
- [x] **Overview, Pagination & Status Constants** -> `src/modules/common-data/constants/`
  - `PAGE_SIZES`, `DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE` (`common-pagination.data.ts`)
  - `TIME_RANGES`, `DEFAULT_TIME_RANGE`, `STAT_TILES` (`common-overview.data.ts`)
  - `STATUS_OPTIONS`, `DEFAULT_STATUS` (`common-status.data.ts`)
  - Deleted duplicate constants from all 4 domain modules.

